{
  "_README": [
    "Unseen semantic cases: questions phrased the way officers actually ask,",
    "none of which the deterministic patterns were written against.",
    "",
    "`intent` lists every reading that would be CORRECT — several frames are",
    "genuinely ambiguous between two intents and the pipeline handles either.",
    "`never` lists readings that would be wrong. unknown_concept appears there",
    "on almost every frame-only question: routing a question that names no",
    "concept into a concept scan is both wrong and expensive.",
    "",
    "`standalone` is what the conversation layer must decide with no history."
  ],

